{{Brainrot Infobox|image1=Cobra Gelato.png|income=77.5M|cost=23.5B|rarity=Secret|creator=[[BRAZILIAN SPYDER]]|status=Obtainable([[DLC]])|caption-image1=I see Cobra cream...|sounds=[[File: CobraGelato.mp3]]|signifiers=LC}}

'''Cobra Gelato''' is a {{Secret}} brainrot.

'''Cobra Gelato''' is a stylized, dessert-themed serpent with a vibrant Neapolitan-inspired color palette. Its coiled lower body features a layered pattern of waffle-cone gold, creamy white, and strawberry pink, meticulously detailed with a blocky, voxelated texture. Rising upward, its underbelly glows with soft cream and pastel pink segments, leading up to an expressive face accented by large, shiny dark eyes, rosy cheeks, and a playfully extended pink tongue. The cobra's flared hood mimics a swirling scoop of ice cream, alternating between rich chocolate brown and vanilla white ridges, all crowned by a pointed dollop of strawberry gelato at the very top.

{{Obtainment|Obtainment=#Getting from a [[MerchShop DLC]] code.|Unstealable=}}

== Trivia ==

# This brainrot has the same stats as Cangurato Gelato, which is also a gelato-related Brainrot.

